# Automatic ERA5 hourly transition with licensed BADA 4 TEM.
# Run with: IC research/era5-tem-transition
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === ERA5 AUTOMATIC TIME TRANSITION GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO Simulation starts at 12:59:30 and crosses into the cached 13:00 slot.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT ERA5 changes from 12:00 to 13:00 without fallback or BADA misses.
00:00:00.15>ECHO TEST EXPECT Matched level-flight REPORT and OFF propagation remains equivalent with no quality events.
00:00:00.20>DATE 15,8,2025,12:59:30
00:00:00.25>PLUGIN LOAD WINDECMWF
00:00:00.30>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.35>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.40>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:00.45>WINDECMWF 40,-5,45,5
00:00:01.00>CRE EWTR,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.00>CRE EWTO,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS EWTR TEM
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS EWTO TEM
00:00:01.40>BADACONFIG EWTR PYBADA
00:00:01.40>BADACONFIG EWTO PYBADA
00:00:01.60>ENVELOPECHECKS EWTR LONGITUDINAL
00:00:01.60>ENVELOPECHECKS EWTO LONGITUDINAL
00:00:01.80>ENVELOPE EWTR REPORT
00:00:01.80>ENVELOPE EWTO OFF
00:00:02.00>RECORDRESEARCH START era5-tem-transition.csv
00:00:35.00>ECHO TEST ACTION The simulation UTC has crossed 13:00. Weather selection follows the exact UTC validity interval.
00:01:01.00>ATMOSSTATUS EWTR
00:01:01.00>ATMOSSTATUS EWTO
00:01:05.00>PERFSTATUS EWTR ALL
00:01:05.00>PERFSTATUS EWTO ALL
00:01:08.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:01:08.10>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_era5_transition_run.py on output/era5-tem-transition.csv.
00:01:09.00>HOLD
